WEBVTT

00:05:59.772 --> 00:06:01.899
so can the value of the NFT.

00:06:02.483 --> 00:06:06.195
Because of NFTs,
Chris Torres, Nyan Cat's creator,

00:06:06.195 --> 00:06:09.573
has received direct compensation
for his creation.

00:06:10.324 --> 00:06:14.161
But what's more is he'll continue
to receive compensation

00:06:14.203 --> 00:06:16.997
every single time the NFT is resold.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:21.001
This is because of the royalty system
baked into the smart contracts

00:06:21.043 --> 00:06:22.837
that govern NFTs.

00:06:23.629 --> 00:06:27.466
NFTs are software; they can be programmed.

00:06:28.259 --> 00:06:30.761
And with something
as complicated as royalties,